# Kinoklip colour scheme: the cool, slightly violet charcoal greys of current professional
# editing interfaces, near-black top and page bars, light grey text and a red accent. Values
# chosen for Kinoklip (GPL-3.0-or-later); file layout follows KDE's colour scheme format.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

